    <description># NoteGen

**Capture first. Organize later.**

A local-first Markdown app that helps you collect scattered information and organize it into clear notes with AI.

![Screenshot](https://cdn.statically.io/gh/Aurocosh/chocolatey-packages/master/automatic/notegen/img/screenshot.png)

## Features

- Capture text, voice, screenshots, images, links, files, and tasks without sorting them first
- Organize selected records into structured Markdown notes with AI
- Markdown editor with tables, math, diagrams, Mermaid, and source mode
- Infinite canvas for flowcharts, mind maps, timelines, and diagrams
- Local-first storage with optional sync via GitHub, GitLab, Gitee, Gitea, S3, or WebDAV
- Knowledge base search, Agent mode, MCP servers, and installable Skills
- No account required for core features

</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/codexu/note-gen/releases/tag/note-gen-v0.35.1</releaseNotes>
